{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"13":"Divorce (Kitab Al-Talaq)"},"section_detail":{"13":{"hadithnumber_first":2175,"hadithnumber_last":2312,"arabicnumber_first":2175,"arabicnumber_last":2312,"name_native":"كتاب الطلاق"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2223,"arabicnumber":2223,"text":"حدثنا زياد بن ايوب، حدثنا اسماعيل، حدثنا الحكم بن ابان، عن عكرمة، عن ابن عباس، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم نحوه ولم يذكر الساق","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":13,"hadith":49}}]}